WEBVTT

00:38.871 --> 00:42.416
No matter how I think about it,
there's only one way.

00:42.500 --> 00:43.834
NO MORE GAMBLING!

00:43.918 --> 00:45.378
The prosecutor.

00:46.546 --> 00:49.048
- Let's take her out.
- But, boss.

00:49.131 --> 00:52.593
Going after a prosecutor
will make things worse.

00:52.677 --> 00:56.264
- Damn, I knew he'd be trouble.
- Get your best men ready.

00:56.389 --> 00:59.016
So they can do the job
when the time is right.

01:05.773 --> 01:07.400
HILLSIDE CAFE

01:13.864 --> 01:16.075
Yes, she's arrived.

01:16.158 --> 01:18.077
She just went into the Hillside Cafe.

01:18.160 --> 01:20.162
Hillside Cafe?

01:27.169 --> 01:28.629
Come on, pick up.

01:58.951 --> 02:01.412
This is driving me crazy.

02:14.508 --> 02:15.843
Taxi!

02:16.886 --> 02:18.054
Wait!

02:27.396 --> 02:30.316
The Passenger Ship Spy Case,
the Kwon Soon-bok Case

02:30.399 --> 02:33.527
and the suicide in March.

02:33.611 --> 02:37.323
Han Gyeong-wook and Yoo In-gu
are definitely linked to these.

02:37.406 --> 02:40.618
That ship that sank ten years ago.

02:40.701 --> 02:42.286
I was on that ship.

02:42.787 --> 02:46.957
And I know everything about the incident
you're so curious about.

02:47.041 --> 02:51.337
Could Gang Beom-ryong
be the one to solve this puzzle?

03:14.694 --> 03:15.820
Get him out of here.

03:28.416 --> 03:29.917
Prosecutor Gang.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.794
About what you asked last time.

03:31.877 --> 03:33.963
I think I have an answer for you.

03:34.046 --> 03:35.214
Is now a good time?

03:35.297 --> 03:36.841
Oh.

03:37.842 --> 03:39.135
I see.

03:39.844 --> 03:41.262
Yes, have a seat.

03:42.179 --> 03:45.057
Actually, it's a bit too loud in here.

03:45.141 --> 03:46.517
Come with me.

03:52.523 --> 03:53.524
Huh?

04:15.921 --> 04:17.757
Hey, grab her!

04:22.511 --> 04:25.306
Hey, open the door! Open up!

04:41.113 --> 04:43.699
How could you let her get away?

04:43.783 --> 04:46.911
- Why are you calling on a regular phone?
- Hey, Ho-myeong.

04:46.994 --> 04:48.954
It's an emergency.
Get over here right now.

04:49.038 --> 04:50.873
What are you talking about? I can't.

04:50.956 --> 04:54.168
- I'm at a show.
- It's Yoo In-gu's crew.

04:54.251 --> 04:57.880
- They're coming to take out Gang.
- What?

04:57.963 --> 04:59.882
- Where are you?
- I'm on Yeongseon Island.

04:59.965 --> 05:03.260
- Prosecutor Gang is on Yeongseon Island?
- Yeah.

05:03.344 --> 05:04.720
Prosecutor Gang

05:05.387 --> 05:08.516
provoked Yoo In-gu,
and now that crazy son of a bitch...

05:08.599 --> 05:11.435
Look, there's no time to explain.
Just get over here, fast!

05:12.853 --> 05:14.188
You must be kidding me.

05:14.271 --> 05:16.732
If you just stay put,
Prosecutor Gang will die, you idiot.

05:19.318 --> 05:22.279
If we lose her now, it's all over.

05:38.587 --> 05:40.339
Damn it.

05:47.972 --> 05:49.473
Ram her!

05:51.767 --> 05:53.394
- I can't.
- Just do it!

05:53.477 --> 05:54.478
Just one more...

05:56.647 --> 05:57.815
Just hit her!

06:00.776 --> 06:03.445
What are you doing, you idiot?
Step on it already!

06:18.085 --> 06:19.378
Why won't it stop?

06:26.093 --> 06:28.304
Where do these bastards
think they're going?

06:36.228 --> 06:39.732
- Why can't you get past her?
- Damn it.

06:39.815 --> 06:40.941
Shit.

06:59.209 --> 07:00.210
Ram her!

07:04.423 --> 07:08.093
Harder!

08:06.819 --> 08:08.821
Hey! What the hell?

08:28.465 --> 08:30.676
YOU CAN LEAVE DEAD, NEVER ALIVE!

08:35.180 --> 08:37.057
Thank you.

08:46.692 --> 08:50.029
LOSE LAND, LOSE HOME, END UP IN DEBT.
YOU CAN LEAVE DEAD, NEVER ALIVE!

09:20.434 --> 09:21.435
Jesus Christ!

09:23.771 --> 09:25.022
It's a ghost.

09:25.105 --> 09:27.941
Hey, wait.

09:28.067 --> 09:30.694
I think I saw a ghost.
The ghost of a young woman.

09:30.778 --> 09:32.529
You get scared so easily.

09:33.822 --> 09:36.617
What kind of job could be
in a place like this?

09:37.618 --> 09:41.205
Look. She's taking us there to be sold.

09:41.288 --> 09:42.414
I can hear you, you know?

09:43.373 --> 09:46.251
This place used to be packed with people.

09:46.752 --> 09:49.838
- But everyone got chased out.
- But why?

09:51.298 --> 09:52.508
Hey, we're here.

09:54.718 --> 09:57.262
- Just get over here.
- Unbelievable.

10:02.184 --> 10:06.855
They barged in and trashed the place
just to catch one woman.

10:09.066 --> 10:10.901
Where did those people go?

10:10.984 --> 10:13.612
I don't know.
They just sped off in their car.

10:13.695 --> 10:16.573
- Which way did they go?
- That way, toward the main road.

10:32.381 --> 10:34.341
Why is Jeong Ho-myeong here?

10:34.424 --> 10:35.425
Gang Beom-ryong.

10:35.509 --> 10:38.262
Why did he show up?
And at a time like this?

10:38.345 --> 10:40.681
Looked like he was looking for
some thugs and a woman.

10:40.764 --> 10:42.724
Is it Prosecutor Gang?

10:42.808 --> 10:44.977
I wonder if Ma Gong-bok
had a different idea.

10:45.060 --> 10:48.063
That means he came to meet
Prosecutor Gang too.

10:48.147 --> 10:51.608
This isn't the time
to worry about Gang Beom-ryong.

10:51.692 --> 10:53.277
My priority is Gang.

10:53.360 --> 10:55.529
Anyway, there's no way that guy knows me.

10:55.612 --> 10:57.156
- For now...
- For now...

10:57.239 --> 10:58.991
- Play it cool.
- Play it cool.

11:25.601 --> 11:26.894
Why the hell are you here?

11:28.061 --> 11:30.856
- This isn't a coincidence, is it?
- You.

11:30.939 --> 11:32.191
Do you know who I am?

11:32.566 --> 11:35.527
- What the hell is this?
- Tell me. How did you know?

11:37.571 --> 11:40.282
Are you just playing dumb,
or are you really that clueless?

11:40.365 --> 11:43.994
Anyway, I don't have time to fool around.
Get out of the way.

11:44.995 --> 11:47.873
You were looking for
Prosecutor Gang, right?

11:47.956 --> 11:50.417
Hurry up and tell me what's going on.

11:54.338 --> 11:57.341
She's in danger right now.

12:15.317 --> 12:16.318
What the hell?

12:17.736 --> 12:19.071
You're tailing her, aren't you?

12:19.947 --> 12:22.241
I need to see her too. Let's go together.

12:22.324 --> 12:23.325
What?

12:23.408 --> 12:25.452
Are you crazy? Get out.

12:25.535 --> 12:27.454
Hey, you think I want to be doing this?

12:27.537 --> 12:29.581
If I'd brought my own car...

12:29.665 --> 12:32.084
- Think this is a taxi?
- I'll pay you well.

12:32.167 --> 12:34.586
You don't even know where she went.

12:35.837 --> 12:37.965
Are you saying you know?

12:38.090 --> 12:39.132
Hold on.

12:40.676 --> 12:43.053
Seriously, where did she go?

12:51.144 --> 12:53.105
- Yes, boss.
- Hey, Gong-bok.

12:53.188 --> 12:54.731
Can you pull some CCTV footage now?

12:54.815 --> 12:55.857
Right now?

12:55.941 --> 12:59.361
Hold on, the CCTV footage from where?

12:59.444 --> 13:02.739
The Hillside Cafe in Nakwon-ri.
Pull the footage from 30 minutes ago.

13:02.823 --> 13:04.741
Look for suspicious vehicles leaving.

13:04.825 --> 13:07.995
- Vehicles?
- Trace their route and contact me. Hurry.

13:08.078 --> 13:10.872
- What's going on?
- No time to explain.

13:10.956 --> 13:13.292
- Just text it to me.
- But...

13:15.127 --> 13:17.546
I'm so damn busy as is.

13:19.006 --> 13:20.340
YEONGSEON ISLAND, NAKWON-RO

13:24.803 --> 13:30.058
HANMAEUM SOCIAL DANCE

13:34.187 --> 13:35.480
Come in.

13:37.399 --> 13:38.734
Aren't you coming in?

13:42.154 --> 13:44.031
Come on, get in.

13:53.999 --> 13:55.292
Just a moment.

14:09.556 --> 14:10.640
Come on up.

14:16.438 --> 14:21.109
This first floor used to be a supermarket,
and the second was cheap single rooms.

14:35.582 --> 14:37.042
Why is he staring?

14:44.966 --> 14:46.134
Hey, there.

14:46.718 --> 14:47.719
Jesus.

15:06.947 --> 15:07.948
Hey.

15:08.865 --> 15:11.159
This is either a pyramid scheme or a cult.

15:11.243 --> 15:14.746
- Let's get out of here.
- Hey, come on. Lee would never.

15:14.830 --> 15:15.997
Aren't you coming up?

15:17.874 --> 15:20.752
Hey. Can you just tell us now?

15:21.545 --> 15:24.047
What exactly is this place?

15:25.048 --> 15:27.300
You can think of it as
a temporary shelter.

15:27.384 --> 15:28.635
A temporary shelter?

15:28.718 --> 15:32.347
Everyone in there
is in the same boat as you are.

15:32.431 --> 15:36.893
They lost their homes to Heaven Capital
and were thrown onto the street overnight.

15:36.977 --> 15:40.021
Our Dance Club set this place up
to help people like them.

15:40.105 --> 15:44.192
- It's just temporary.
- Wait, a place like this...

15:44.276 --> 15:46.403
...was set up by a Dance Club?

15:46.486 --> 15:50.073
We used to have a few members
in our Dance Club

15:50.157 --> 15:51.658
who had family problems.

15:53.160 --> 15:54.953
- Come on up.
- Okay.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.800
SEVERAL VEHICLES GOT INTO A CAR CHASE
AND HEADED TOWARDS YEONGSEON RIVER

16:08.884 --> 16:09.968
Make your choice.

16:13.263 --> 16:16.516
Trying to take credit
for what Ma Gong-bok sent?

16:17.642 --> 16:18.643
You know Gong-bok, too?

16:18.727 --> 16:21.146
You think I wouldn't notice
pathetic thugs like you?

16:21.229 --> 16:24.816
- Are you sure he checked properly?
- You don't have time to be doubting me.

16:24.900 --> 16:26.902
You said Prosecutor Gang's in danger.

16:30.447 --> 16:32.449
HILLSIDE CAFE

16:56.139 --> 16:59.935
My family's threatening to disown me
for losing our family burial ground.

17:00.018 --> 17:02.687
- What am I to do?
- Well, why did you sign off on it?

17:02.812 --> 17:04.189
You try dealing with them!

17:04.481 --> 17:06.608
Could you stand up to them
when they threaten you?

17:06.691 --> 17:07.692
Shut it!

17:08.568 --> 17:11.530
Back in my day,
I didn't even blink if I got stabbed.

17:11.655 --> 17:13.198
How dare you?

17:14.282 --> 17:16.785
- Mr. Park, we're here.
- Yeah.

17:16.868 --> 17:20.956
Anyway, you have to keep your promise
about getting the family burial ground.

17:26.378 --> 17:29.881
Where is everyone?
Why do I always get stuck with this?

17:29.965 --> 17:33.843
The others all had plans, you know.
And you're the best at this.

17:33.969 --> 17:36.805
They start all this,
then leave me to clean up the mess...

17:39.474 --> 17:40.475
And who are they?

17:41.017 --> 17:42.644
Why'd you bring these stragglers?

17:42.727 --> 17:45.397
I told you about him.
Manager Bong from my company.

17:46.064 --> 17:47.065
Say hello.

17:47.148 --> 17:49.859
This is Mr. Park Chun-sik.
He's in charge of this shelter.

17:49.943 --> 17:51.236
Ah, the boss.

17:51.319 --> 17:54.072
Pleasure to meet you.
My name is Bong Je-sun.

17:54.155 --> 17:56.032
Ah.

17:56.157 --> 18:00.412
The poor guy who lost his house and job
because of his nephew?

18:02.789 --> 18:04.583
Did they tell you what this place is?

18:05.000 --> 18:09.045
- And what you have to do?
- I was told it's a temporary shelter.

18:10.463 --> 18:12.799
That's a nice way of putting it.

18:12.882 --> 18:17.470
We feed and house people
who lost their homes to those thugs.

18:17.554 --> 18:20.765
You won't find a charity case
bigger than this.

18:21.182 --> 18:23.393
And not a single cent from the government.

18:23.476 --> 18:27.105
I'm working myself to the bone
trying to run this place.

18:27.188 --> 18:29.441
And my joints are killing me.

18:29.524 --> 18:30.942
Well, you're doing a good thing.

18:31.443 --> 18:32.861
Right, a good thing.

18:32.944 --> 18:36.239
But do you think I should be
doing it all by myself?

18:37.198 --> 18:38.908
So while you're staying here,

18:39.034 --> 18:42.454
you can help with cleaning, maintenance,
and a little cooking.

18:43.246 --> 18:47.083
- So, it's a kind of...
- You're asking him to be a slave.

18:47.917 --> 18:49.336
What? A slave?

18:49.961 --> 18:51.463
Don't be ridiculous.

18:51.588 --> 18:54.257
We provide room and board.
We'll even pay you a little.

18:54.341 --> 18:57.469
And we're trying to get people's
illegally seized homes back.

18:57.552 --> 18:59.596
Where else will you find
a perfect job like this?

18:59.679 --> 19:01.139
Can we get our homes back?

19:01.222 --> 19:03.725
Well, the number of victims
keeps increasing,

19:04.100 --> 19:06.895
so we're trying to come up with
a plan ourselves.

19:06.978 --> 19:09.814
Hey, you're not actually buying this,
are you?

19:09.898 --> 19:13.401
They're just trying to use you!

19:13.485 --> 19:17.489
- Seriously!
- Hey, who's this little punk?

19:17.572 --> 19:18.865
Hey, old man.

19:20.075 --> 19:23.244
I get that my uncle looks
like an easy target.

19:23.328 --> 19:25.288
You probably think you can
take advantage of him.

19:25.372 --> 19:28.958
He may be, but I'm no pushover. Got it?

19:30.377 --> 19:31.544
Let's go.

19:31.670 --> 19:33.338
Go where?

19:33.421 --> 19:35.548
You want to stay in a dump like this?

19:35.674 --> 19:38.635
- Have some pride.
- What? A dump?

19:39.219 --> 19:43.223
- A dump? This little punk...
- Stop it. What are you doing?

19:43.348 --> 19:45.725
Okay. All right.

19:45.809 --> 19:49.145
We don't need a punk like you.

19:49.229 --> 19:50.772
As far as I can tell?

19:50.855 --> 19:53.900
You're a lost cause.
You couldn't do the job right anyway.

19:53.983 --> 19:55.568
"Punk?"

19:59.698 --> 20:00.949
Old man.

20:01.950 --> 20:02.951
Do you know me?

20:03.034 --> 20:05.787
Hey, Heo Nam-il.
Why are you being so rude?

20:05.870 --> 20:09.040
Uncle, didn't you hear
that old man insulting me?

20:09.124 --> 20:11.668
You're being insulting.
You called this place a dump.

20:12.419 --> 20:13.503
Apologize right now.

20:14.295 --> 20:16.464
Why should I apologize?

20:18.675 --> 20:21.136
You think that's right?
What about this one?

20:22.387 --> 20:26.266
I'm not going to live like a slave
in a dump like this.

20:26.391 --> 20:27.434
You can stay.

20:30.186 --> 20:32.313
Calm down.

20:32.397 --> 20:33.982
I'm so sorry.

20:34.983 --> 20:36.109
I'm sorry.

20:37.110 --> 20:38.528
He's not normally like that.

20:38.611 --> 20:40.447
I don't know what's gotten into him.
I'll go get him.

20:40.530 --> 20:41.573
Man, that hurts.

20:41.865 --> 20:43.158
Hey, Heo Nam-il!

20:44.743 --> 20:46.035
Unbelievable.

20:47.036 --> 20:50.123
They don't look alike at all.
Is he really his uncle?

20:52.584 --> 20:54.210
SEVERAL VEHICLES GOT INTO A CAR CHASE
AND HEADED TOWARDS YEONGSEON RIVER

20:57.088 --> 20:59.174
Earlier, at the cafe.

20:59.257 --> 21:02.010
Those thugs work for Yoo In-gu, right?

21:02.093 --> 21:05.430
Why is that bastard Yoo In-gu after Gang?

21:05.513 --> 21:06.598
You know why, don't you?

21:06.681 --> 21:09.642
Even if I knew,
you think I'd tell a punk like you?

21:09.726 --> 21:10.935
A punk like me?

21:11.019 --> 21:14.939
The enemy who ruined my operation.
The stalker on my tail for a decade.

21:15.023 --> 21:18.193
A Hwasan Sect gangster pretending
to be a convenience store owner.

21:18.276 --> 21:19.277
You...

21:19.360 --> 21:21.988
- You knew all along.
- Stop acting like my buddy.

21:22.071 --> 21:24.616
I could easily toss you off this car.

21:25.241 --> 21:26.618
What did you say?

21:37.462 --> 21:38.463
What happened here?

21:39.130 --> 21:40.799
A car fell into the river.

21:45.178 --> 21:47.597
Could it be Gang?

21:49.516 --> 21:50.642
Hold on.

21:52.268 --> 21:53.269
That bastard.

21:56.272 --> 21:58.149
He's one of Yoo In-gu's men.

22:00.944 --> 22:03.154
What's he doing here now?

22:06.991 --> 22:09.160
Could they have already gotten her?

22:10.370 --> 22:11.454
Hey! Wait!

22:11.538 --> 22:13.331
Hey! Where are you going?

22:13.414 --> 22:15.542
Hey, stop! I'm coming with you!

22:21.506 --> 22:22.799
Nam-il.

22:24.634 --> 22:26.094
- Nam-il!
- What?

22:28.429 --> 22:30.181
You can't just leave like this.

22:30.849 --> 22:33.434
- Let's go back. I'll talk to them.
- Go by yourself.

22:33.977 --> 22:35.353
I'm going to a friend's.

22:36.354 --> 22:37.856
Don't you know thugs are chasing us?

22:37.939 --> 22:41.401
Yeah, and why would that be?
They've already taken our house.

22:42.026 --> 22:45.989
It's because you beat their guys up.

22:46.072 --> 22:47.657
I can't believe what I'm hearing.

22:48.575 --> 22:50.535
Whose fault is it that we're in this mess?

22:50.618 --> 22:51.661
This is my fault?

22:51.744 --> 22:52.745
Who else?

22:52.829 --> 22:55.957
You're always getting into trouble.
You've been held back two years!

22:56.040 --> 22:58.293
And you even lost the house.
When are you going to grow up?

22:58.376 --> 23:00.128
Then pretend I don't exist!

23:01.838 --> 23:03.840
After all, we're not even related.

23:07.468 --> 23:08.928
Nam-il! Seriously.

23:09.012 --> 23:10.555
Hey.

23:12.557 --> 23:15.351
- Are you really leaving?
- Think I enjoy calling you Uncle?

23:16.227 --> 23:19.063
I felt sorry you had no memory
and nowhere to go.

23:20.064 --> 23:21.941
So I was playing family with you.

23:23.943 --> 23:24.944
And Grandpa's house?

23:25.945 --> 23:28.197
It's not your house, but mine.

23:29.115 --> 23:32.076
So stop meddling
and promising you'll get it back.

23:33.077 --> 23:34.954
From now on,
let's just go our separate ways.

23:35.580 --> 23:36.748
Okay?

24:07.195 --> 24:09.572
- Hey, did you find him?
- We were one step behind.

24:09.656 --> 24:12.367
Prosecutor Gang's car crashed
into the Yeongseon River.

24:12.492 --> 24:14.786
It looks like she was
being chased by Yoo In-gu.

24:14.911 --> 24:15.912
You're saying she's dead?

24:15.995 --> 24:17.872
Don't know yet.
They're recovering the vehicle.

24:17.956 --> 24:19.415
Where are you? Let's meet.

24:19.499 --> 24:20.500
No, no.

24:21.459 --> 24:23.211
No, Ho-myeong. Then you should just...

24:23.294 --> 24:25.088
You should just go back.

24:25.630 --> 24:26.965
What are you saying?

24:29.175 --> 24:31.177
Didn't you say you were with your family?

24:32.095 --> 24:33.429
Go back to them now.

24:33.513 --> 24:36.599
I can't go back now.
I have to see if Gang is alive.

24:36.724 --> 24:41.145
They're just pulling up the car now.
It'll take all day to know.

24:41.229 --> 24:44.649
I'll tap into the police radio,
so you hurry back.

24:44.732 --> 24:47.443
The show's already over. It's too late.

24:47.527 --> 24:48.528
Hey, man.

24:48.611 --> 24:51.864
The longer you drag out a fight,
the worse it's going to be.

24:51.948 --> 24:56.119
We haven't even found Gang.
You want to lose your wife too?

24:59.414 --> 25:00.498
All right.

25:00.581 --> 25:02.667
- Call me if anything happens.
- Got it.

25:45.209 --> 25:48.212
- Grandpa. There's someone over there.
- Where?

25:48.296 --> 25:50.298
- Over there!
- Oh, dear.

25:50.381 --> 25:51.674
Go on, hurry!

25:52.675 --> 25:54.052
What on earth?

25:58.848 --> 26:00.391
Miss, wake up.

26:00.475 --> 26:01.934
Can you hear me?

26:03.394 --> 26:05.813
Grandpa, that's not a woman.

26:05.897 --> 26:07.774
He's a man. Look!

26:45.770 --> 26:46.854
Je-sun?

27:04.455 --> 27:05.748
I...

27:08.209 --> 27:09.418
don't remember.

27:09.544 --> 27:11.629
You really don't remember anything?

27:12.880 --> 27:16.217
Your age, your name, your parents.

27:17.802 --> 27:18.803
Nothing?

27:19.303 --> 27:21.806
No. I don't know.

27:30.690 --> 27:34.861
- You don't have a mom and dad either?
- I don't know.

27:35.987 --> 27:39.115
- I don't know if I do.
- If you really don't...

27:40.116 --> 27:42.952
- do you want to be part of our family?
- Family?

27:43.035 --> 27:46.038
I don't just let anyone in,
but I'll make an exception for you.

27:47.165 --> 27:48.833
You can't be my grandpa or dad.

27:49.667 --> 27:51.043
What about my uncle?

27:51.127 --> 27:52.170
Uncle?

27:53.504 --> 27:54.797
An uncle.

27:56.591 --> 28:00.178
- What would an uncle do?
- You have to play with me.

28:00.261 --> 28:01.512
All the time.

28:03.890 --> 28:05.683
You're my uncle now, okay?

28:07.476 --> 28:08.853
Uncle, play with me.

28:10.730 --> 28:14.192
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
BONG JE-SUN, 215 DOYANG-RO, CHUNCHEON

28:24.577 --> 28:26.120
Uncle, are you bored?

28:27.330 --> 28:29.415
If you're so bored,
you can help me with this.

28:39.342 --> 28:41.010
Don't let go.

28:41.093 --> 28:44.013
- First time on a two-wheeler?
- Yeah.

28:46.307 --> 28:47.433
I won't let go.

29:02.949 --> 29:04.200
Where are you right now?

29:09.288 --> 29:10.373
Huh?

29:21.384 --> 29:22.802
Hey!

29:23.511 --> 29:25.721
Hey!

29:25.805 --> 29:27.598
Are you okay? Hey!

29:28.224 --> 29:29.475
Oh, no.

29:29.558 --> 29:31.477
Are you okay? Hey!

29:32.228 --> 29:33.896
Hey!

29:46.993 --> 29:48.160
Can you hear me?

29:48.244 --> 29:50.621
You're okay now. You're alive.

29:50.705 --> 29:56.419
- I'll call 911 for you.
- Don't call anyone.

29:58.754 --> 30:00.881
Hey!

30:02.300 --> 30:03.634
Oh, gosh.

30:12.977 --> 30:14.437
Jeez.

30:14.562 --> 30:17.773
Don't go out of your way to get yelled at.
Give up on him.

30:17.898 --> 30:20.318
With a nephew like that,
would he be any different?

30:20.443 --> 30:24.488
I'm telling you, he's not like that.
He's not picking up.

30:29.869 --> 30:30.911
Mi-kyung.

30:31.495 --> 30:33.164
Didn't you say you had a date today?

30:33.247 --> 30:36.125
I don't know. Don't ask.

30:36.208 --> 30:37.752
Looks to me like you got rejected.

30:38.544 --> 30:40.755
I thought the guy was totally into you.

30:41.922 --> 30:43.174
I don't know, okay?

30:43.257 --> 30:47.053
I may have been rejected in person,
but I've never been ghosted.

30:47.136 --> 30:48.471
I wouldn't be so sure.

30:52.099 --> 30:53.434
Damn it.

30:53.517 --> 30:55.019
O-ran.

30:55.102 --> 30:57.021
Weren't you seeing a show
with your family?

30:57.104 --> 31:01.150
We already saw the show.
I was just dropping Ji-woo off at home.

31:01.233 --> 31:03.986
Already?
Weren't you going somewhere nice after?

31:04.070 --> 31:05.446
Don't ask.

31:07.323 --> 31:09.700
Jeez, things are pretty tense
over here too.

31:10.368 --> 31:13.537
Oh, by the way, Ye-ji,
did the person you were bringing show up?

31:13.621 --> 31:15.039
Is he going to work here?

31:16.040 --> 31:17.208
About that.

31:17.291 --> 31:20.044
He's not answering his phone right now.

31:32.431 --> 31:35.184
She looks pretty hurt.

31:35.267 --> 31:36.977
Shouldn't we take her to a hospital?

31:37.061 --> 31:39.647
Oh, no. No hospital.

31:39.730 --> 31:44.235
No police, no 911.
She kept saying that the whole way here.

31:46.237 --> 31:47.696
I've got a bad feeling about this.

31:48.239 --> 31:50.950
Usually, only people trying
to evade the law

31:51.075 --> 31:53.244
go around saying you can't call the cops.

31:53.327 --> 31:56.122
Oh, my! So she's a criminal?

31:56.747 --> 31:57.748
No.

31:58.416 --> 31:59.959
- I think she's a prosecutor.
- What?

32:02.878 --> 32:04.004
- She's a prosecutor.
- Oh, my!

32:04.797 --> 32:06.924
She said not to call anyone.

32:07.007 --> 32:08.843
This wasn't a simple accident.

32:11.178 --> 32:15.391
In that case,
let's just wait until she wakes up.

32:15.474 --> 32:18.519
If she's weird when she wakes up,
Mi-kyung can take care of her.

32:18.602 --> 32:20.563
Yeah, let's do that.

32:22.565 --> 32:23.566
Hey.

32:24.900 --> 32:27.361
- Bong Je-sun, right?
- Yes.

32:27.445 --> 32:28.821
I see you left your nephew.

32:28.904 --> 32:31.198
I guess you decided to work
in this dump, huh?

32:31.282 --> 32:33.367
Well, it's not like I abandoned him.

32:33.451 --> 32:35.286
As for the job...

32:35.369 --> 32:37.663
- I'd like to give it a shot.
- All right.

32:37.746 --> 32:39.248
Let's start right away.

32:39.331 --> 32:40.875
Don't think about getting any sleep.

32:40.958 --> 32:44.336
You'll stay here and keep an eye on her.

32:44.420 --> 32:47.465
When she wakes up,
you contact us all immediately.

32:47.548 --> 32:48.549
Got it?

32:49.216 --> 32:50.426
Uh, by myself?

32:50.509 --> 32:51.677
Of course!

32:51.760 --> 32:53.471
You brought her,
so you're responsible for her.

32:53.554 --> 32:55.598
She better not end up a corpse
in my building.

32:56.140 --> 32:57.558
Is that clear?

33:02.271 --> 33:04.315
Grandpa surrenders!
Please just spare my life!

33:04.398 --> 33:05.816
Oh, no!

33:07.067 --> 33:08.235
Hey, it's Daddy.

33:09.445 --> 33:10.738
- Daddy!
- Ji-woo!

33:10.821 --> 33:13.782
I'm sorry I came so late!

33:13.866 --> 33:15.117
- It's okay.
- Did you like the show?

33:15.201 --> 33:16.577
- Yes.
- Hey.

33:16.660 --> 33:19.079
- Just getting home?
- Yes.

33:19.163 --> 33:21.415
Daddy, check out my new mask.

33:21.499 --> 33:24.376
- Isn't it cool?
- Wow, it's so cool.

33:27.087 --> 33:28.255
- Daddy.
- Yeah?

33:28.339 --> 33:30.216
Did you beat the bad guys?

33:31.550 --> 33:32.676
Yes.

33:34.094 --> 33:37.932
- But where's Mom?
- She dropped off Ji-woo and went out.

33:38.015 --> 33:41.769
- Where to?
- I don't know. She was furious.

33:41.852 --> 33:45.356
She said she needed to
blow off some steam.

33:47.358 --> 33:50.152
It's okay. Mom will understand.

34:25.604 --> 34:28.482
I'm sorry. I have no excuse, really.

34:30.401 --> 34:31.610
No, I'm sure you do.

34:32.319 --> 34:33.779
Go on.

34:33.862 --> 34:36.323
I'll decide if I'll forgive you
after I hear it.

34:46.625 --> 34:50.170
One of my army buddies
is a guy named Tae-sik.

34:50.921 --> 34:54.258
He came to visit Yeongseon Island
and got into a car accident.

34:54.341 --> 34:58.262
He was panicking and thinking
if he knew anyone on Yeongseon Island.

34:58.345 --> 35:00.764
And I came to mind.

35:00.848 --> 35:03.934
So what could I do?
I couldn't just ignore a friend.

35:04.018 --> 35:07.605
So I helped him sort out the accident.

35:07.688 --> 35:11.483
And before I knew it,
it had gotten this late.

35:12.484 --> 35:13.777
I see.

35:14.445 --> 35:17.364
So your friend just happened to be here.

35:18.407 --> 35:20.576
- And he got into an accident.
- Yeah.

35:20.659 --> 35:23.287
Well, I guess you had no choice.

35:23.370 --> 35:26.915
- Right? You understand, right?
- Yeah, of course.

35:26.999 --> 35:30.794
But I didn't know you had army buddies.

35:30.878 --> 35:34.840
I mean, I didn't see a single one
of your friends at our wedding.

35:34.923 --> 35:36.592
So I thought you had none.

35:36.675 --> 35:40.971
Of course I have friends.
He was just too busy back then.

35:41.055 --> 35:42.890
He called me.
He said sorry he couldn't come.

35:42.973 --> 35:44.600
Uh-huh.

35:44.683 --> 35:48.437
But remember when I asked you before?

35:48.520 --> 35:51.649
You told me you were exempt
from military service.

35:54.818 --> 35:56.111
- I did?
- Yes.

36:05.120 --> 36:06.413
What's with you?

36:07.748 --> 36:11.835
You keep leaving the shop,
you forget to pick up Ji-woo.

36:11.919 --> 36:14.254
It's like your mind is somewhere else.

36:14.338 --> 36:18.133
Even today.
Lying to me about what you were up to.

36:18.217 --> 36:19.218
What are you hiding from me?

36:27.017 --> 36:28.769
- Are you seeing someone else?
- No.

36:28.852 --> 36:32.606
Then what is it? Tell me.
Stop lying and just be honest.

36:32.690 --> 36:35.401
It's not like that.
I'm not doing anything wrong.

36:35.484 --> 36:37.611
It's always the same with you.

36:39.863 --> 36:41.824
If you want to live like that,
just get out.

36:41.949 --> 36:44.451
Yeah. You should just get out.

36:44.535 --> 36:47.162
Let's take some time apart.

36:49.331 --> 36:50.374
What did you say?

36:51.208 --> 36:52.209
So, what...

36:52.835 --> 36:54.670
Are you saying I should move out?

36:54.753 --> 36:56.922
What about the shop?
And what about Ji-woo?

36:57.005 --> 37:00.592
The shop will be fine without you,
and I can take care of Ji-woo.

37:04.221 --> 37:05.264
It's your choice.

37:05.347 --> 37:07.516
Either be honest with me...

37:08.183 --> 37:10.436
or get kicked out right now.

37:23.323 --> 37:25.993
- Why are you here so early?
- Gong-bok.

37:26.076 --> 37:29.121
Why were you asking about the CCTV?
Is something up?

37:29.204 --> 37:30.497
Tell me something.

37:31.248 --> 37:33.917
Have you been keeping tabs
on Jeong Ho-myeong?

37:35.085 --> 37:38.088
Jeong... Oh, yeah. Jeong Ho-myeong.

37:38.172 --> 37:39.882
Did you notice anything suspicious?

37:39.965 --> 37:43.635
For instance,
did he seem to know who we were?

37:48.348 --> 37:50.392
Not at all.

37:50.476 --> 37:54.313
The guy has never even seen my face.
I told you.

37:54.438 --> 37:57.941
That I would forget everything.
I had completely forgotten about it.

37:58.025 --> 38:00.027
- Right?
- Yeah.

38:00.694 --> 38:01.904
Well, that's a relief.

38:03.530 --> 38:05.908
It's just...

38:06.658 --> 38:07.826
I thought I saw him out there.

38:10.662 --> 38:11.914
Oh, is that right?

38:13.123 --> 38:16.001
Well, he lives in the neighborhood,

38:16.084 --> 38:18.962
so maybe you just bumped into him.

38:20.798 --> 38:22.007
I'm gonna head in.

38:22.925 --> 38:23.926
Okay.

38:34.353 --> 38:35.813
What's gotten into him?

38:37.147 --> 38:38.565
When did he get so smart?

38:45.072 --> 38:46.573
NO CALLER ID

38:51.912 --> 38:55.415
- Yes, sir.
- Right. So how'd it go?

38:55.958 --> 38:57.042
With Prosecutor Gang.

38:57.709 --> 39:00.212
- The meeting went well.
- She say anything?

39:03.590 --> 39:06.385
She said she'd look into your case.

39:06.510 --> 39:09.388
That's it? There was nothing else?

39:09.471 --> 39:10.806
Anything at all?

39:10.889 --> 39:12.057
I'm sorry, boss.

39:13.809 --> 39:17.729
No, it's fine. Rome wasn't built in a day.

39:18.772 --> 39:21.191
What matters is what comes next.

39:23.402 --> 39:25.988
I'm counting on you.

39:26.071 --> 39:28.824
You know what I mean, right?

39:29.533 --> 39:33.120
Yes. I'll do my best, no matter what.

40:02.274 --> 40:04.151
Is something wrong?

40:04.234 --> 40:07.946
You should've told me
if you couldn't make it.

40:09.239 --> 40:12.367
Hey, is everything okay?

40:13.035 --> 40:14.411
So...

40:14.494 --> 40:17.080
I'm still at the cafe
in front of the theater.

40:17.164 --> 40:20.667
Please call me when you get this.
I'll be waiting.

40:27.132 --> 40:30.886
OFFICER PARK MI-KYUNG

40:34.640 --> 40:37.225
OFFICER PARK MI-KYUNG

40:50.072 --> 40:54.368
Here's the thing about love.
It always comes without warning.

40:55.702 --> 41:00.415
On a day you least expect,
in an ordinary, passing moment...

41:00.540 --> 41:03.710
It quietly sits down right beside you.

41:04.753 --> 41:07.047
And because it always begins like that...

41:07.130 --> 41:10.926
you may even discover a side of yourself
you never knew existed.

41:12.344 --> 41:16.848
Here's our first song.
"Rebirth" by Yoon Jong-shin.

41:30.570 --> 41:32.197
- Good night.
- You too.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.573
See you.

41:36.034 --> 41:37.703
This is no time to fool around.

41:38.954 --> 41:41.790
- Hey, did you know?
- What?

41:41.873 --> 41:43.250
A police precinct moved in nearby.

41:43.333 --> 41:46.753
Lately, the cops on the night shift
have been coming to the store a lot.

41:46.837 --> 41:50.007
Damn, why did those bastards
have to move here?

41:50.090 --> 41:51.299
What do we do?

41:51.383 --> 41:53.301
At this rate,
we might not find our merchandise.

41:53.427 --> 41:56.054
Damn, it's not like I can put up
a sign that says "No Cops."

41:56.972 --> 42:00.767
Just wait. Every cop I see,
I'm just gonna...

42:00.851 --> 42:02.394
Beat them up?

42:03.895 --> 42:06.023
I'm gonna be a total asshole to them.

42:06.106 --> 42:08.358
I'll make them never want
to come near the store.

42:27.753 --> 42:29.171
Aren't you going to ring me up?

42:38.221 --> 42:40.182
Damn it.

42:41.600 --> 42:43.226
Damn it.

43:02.871 --> 43:04.998
Can you check me out?

43:18.303 --> 43:20.555
Excuse me, where is the microwave?

43:21.181 --> 43:22.557
Over there.

43:24.893 --> 43:26.186
Thank you.

45:18.590 --> 45:20.050
That'll be 1,600 won.

45:36.149 --> 45:37.400
One's for you.

45:39.986 --> 45:42.739
It's just a little something
to say thank you.

45:43.657 --> 45:44.991
I'll be here often.

46:03.426 --> 46:05.303
How am I supposed to take this?

46:44.843 --> 46:45.927
I got kicked out.

46:46.845 --> 46:47.929
Why?

46:52.851 --> 46:56.146
I've been watching
the scene of Gang's accident.

46:56.229 --> 46:58.440
The Yeongseon River's current
is very strong.

46:58.523 --> 47:02.444
It'll take a while to pull the car out
and to recover the body.

47:02.527 --> 47:03.570
Think she's dead?

47:03.653 --> 47:04.654
No clue.

47:04.738 --> 47:07.073
We'll just have to keep searching
and hope for the best.

47:12.912 --> 47:14.164
Are you okay?

47:15.290 --> 47:16.708
I'm fine, man.

47:16.791 --> 47:18.335
This is nothing.

47:18.960 --> 47:21.421
Take it easy.
You're not getting any younger.

47:21.504 --> 47:23.590
And maybe tone down
the street vendor disguise.

47:24.174 --> 47:25.175
Hey.

47:26.092 --> 47:28.636
It's not like I can just sit
in an office in a suit.

47:28.720 --> 47:30.013
Intel doesn't find itself.

47:30.096 --> 47:33.391
Besides, what's wrong with this?
I gather intel and make a living.

47:33.475 --> 47:34.976
It's the best.

47:35.060 --> 47:36.770
Nothing beats it.

47:37.520 --> 47:39.230
You really never change.

47:39.647 --> 47:40.732
Don't you ever get tired?

47:41.483 --> 47:42.484
What, are you tired?

47:49.282 --> 47:50.867
I've been in Yeongseon for a while.

47:51.576 --> 47:53.411
It's been ten years already.

47:55.413 --> 47:56.581
Time flies, doesn't it?

48:01.044 --> 48:05.382
When I first came here ten years ago?

48:05.465 --> 48:06.466
I thought...

48:07.050 --> 48:08.885
I'd be done with the operation in no time.

48:12.555 --> 48:14.057
But that damn Bulgae.

48:14.140 --> 48:17.519
I searched and searched,
but there was no sign of him.

48:17.602 --> 48:19.646
And the receiver was dead silent.

48:22.023 --> 48:25.860
He has a strange accent,
and he's just a bit shorter than me.

48:25.944 --> 48:27.112
His face...

48:27.195 --> 48:29.531
Do you know
how many tourists like that we get?

48:29.614 --> 48:30.824
Seriously.

48:33.076 --> 48:34.828
May I take a look inside?

48:34.953 --> 48:37.747
Mind your own business.
Get out or I'll call the police.

48:52.011 --> 48:53.346
ORAN CHINESE RESTAURANT

48:54.806 --> 48:56.224
DELIVERY RIDER WANTED

48:56.307 --> 48:57.350
- Delivery!
- Hey.

48:57.434 --> 48:58.518
- Hi.
- The room at the end.

48:58.601 --> 48:59.686
Okay.

49:06.401 --> 49:07.569
Delivery!

49:10.405 --> 49:12.657
ORAN CHINESE RESTAURANT

49:13.783 --> 49:15.076
The whole idea...

49:16.077 --> 49:18.663
...was that I could investigate
more freely...

49:18.746 --> 49:19.998
...as a delivery guy.

49:25.628 --> 49:30.175
You're not quite what we're looking for.

49:31.176 --> 49:33.303
I'm afraid we can't hire you.

49:47.400 --> 49:48.401
Who is that?

49:48.485 --> 49:50.653
He's here for the interview, but he's...

49:50.737 --> 49:52.572
- Well, he's a little on the older side.
- Hired!

49:54.574 --> 49:57.410
- But...
- He's hired.

49:57.494 --> 49:58.786
You're hired.

50:02.123 --> 50:03.458
I'm back.

50:03.541 --> 50:05.210
- Oh, well done.
- You must be freezing.

50:05.293 --> 50:06.628
Not really.

50:06.711 --> 50:10.507
- Here you go. Enjoy your meal.
- Oh my, were you cold?

50:10.965 --> 50:12.967
No, not really.

50:13.843 --> 50:16.804
Hey, stop what you're doing
and make the deliveries.

50:16.888 --> 50:18.306
We agreed I wouldn't.

50:18.389 --> 50:21.684
You're starting today.
And Ho-myeong, you can wait tables.

50:21.768 --> 50:23.978
- No, I'm fine.
- I can't have you catching a cold.

50:24.646 --> 50:26.105
But I have a cold too.

50:30.485 --> 50:31.861
Be safe out there.

50:34.405 --> 50:36.741
But the operation...

50:37.408 --> 50:39.911
...kept taking turns I didn't expect.

51:03.142 --> 51:05.562
This is tough, isn't it? Let me help.

51:05.645 --> 51:07.730
I was hired to be a delivery driver,
wasn't I?

51:08.481 --> 51:11.985
- Why do you have me doing work inside?
- Oh, about that.

51:15.613 --> 51:18.700
It's because you're so good at your job.

51:18.783 --> 51:20.159
You've been promoted.

51:20.243 --> 51:21.286
Promoted.

51:21.911 --> 51:23.580
- Promoted?
- Yes.

51:25.039 --> 51:26.583
Promoted.

51:31.087 --> 51:32.589
- Are you crying?
- No, it's...

51:33.214 --> 51:36.134
It's the onions.
Ugh, my eyes are stinging.

51:36.259 --> 51:39.387
No, don't rub them with your hands.
Hold still. Let me...

51:40.179 --> 51:42.557
Hold on. Oh, goodness.

51:52.275 --> 51:53.693
Ho-myeong.

51:53.776 --> 51:56.613
Your eyes are beautiful.

52:01.242 --> 52:02.827
I guess I should peel some more onions.

52:02.910 --> 52:04.495
These onions, huh?

52:07.957 --> 52:11.377
Ah, wait. I can't.
This isn't right. Hold on.

52:11.461 --> 52:13.838
No, we can't do this.

52:14.839 --> 52:17.759
Life, operations...

52:19.177 --> 52:21.721
You never know what'll happen next.

52:24.557 --> 52:27.018
Who would've thought
ten years would fly by?

52:27.101 --> 52:30.688
That's why I told you not to get married,
but you went and did it anyway.

52:30.772 --> 52:34.150
- You regret it now?
- Who says I regret it?

52:34.233 --> 52:37.779
I have never once regretted
marrying O-ran.

52:37.862 --> 52:39.614
Then what's the problem?

52:41.282 --> 52:42.575
It's just...

52:46.871 --> 52:48.164
I've been a little...

52:49.457 --> 52:50.458
worried.

52:54.629 --> 52:56.255
About what?

52:59.133 --> 53:03.513
I'm worried that the next ten years
might just fly by in a flash too.

53:04.931 --> 53:08.893
What with menopause and all that,
she's getting weaker by the day.

53:09.852 --> 53:14.524
Ji-woo is still just in kindergarten.
Our income isn't stable.

53:14.607 --> 53:17.193
When I first had a family,
I was just so happy.

53:17.276 --> 53:18.986
I felt like I could do anything.

53:19.070 --> 53:22.073
But these days,
seeing how fast time is going by...

53:24.117 --> 53:25.410
It's terrifying.

53:27.662 --> 53:33.334
I wonder if I'll be able to
take care of my family properly.

53:36.003 --> 53:37.296
I'm losing my confidence.

53:41.134 --> 53:43.928
Watching you mope like this,
I know exactly what's wrong.

53:48.141 --> 53:49.809
It's because you're getting old.

53:51.060 --> 53:53.146
Hey, who isn't anxious
about the future at our age?

53:54.105 --> 53:56.107
- You feel that way too?
- Of course.

53:56.858 --> 53:58.526
I'm no exception.

53:58.609 --> 54:01.154
You just live with it.

54:02.905 --> 54:05.950
Just think that you've only lived
half your life.

54:06.951 --> 54:09.996
And just keep dealing with
what's in front of you.

54:10.830 --> 54:11.831
You'll get through it.

54:13.624 --> 54:15.084
And another thing.

54:15.710 --> 54:19.005
Don't try to shoulder the burden yourself.

54:19.505 --> 54:21.299
This operation isn't going well.

54:21.382 --> 54:24.385
And with what happened to O-ran,
you're struggling mentally, too.

54:24.469 --> 54:28.556
That's why as we get older,
we have to rely on each other

54:28.639 --> 54:30.683
to get through life together.

54:31.684 --> 54:33.603
Honestly, have you learned nothing?

54:41.652 --> 54:43.279
Which brings me to my point.

54:44.280 --> 54:46.574
Why don't we stop
doing this operation as a duo?

54:48.201 --> 54:50.912
What do you say we recruit a new member?

54:52.371 --> 54:53.498
Who?

54:53.581 --> 54:55.708
Do you still have contacts at the agency?

54:55.792 --> 54:59.086
No, why look so far?
He's right under our noses.

55:03.257 --> 55:06.636
He wants to take down
Han Gyeong-wook and Yoo In-gu.

55:07.136 --> 55:08.596
He wants it just as badly as we do.

55:09.722 --> 55:12.141
Your rival from ten years ago.

55:12.266 --> 55:15.478
Someone who can take a hell of a beating.

55:17.271 --> 55:19.607
What about Gang Beom-ryong?

55:21.943 --> 55:25.696
- That's ridiculous. Are you drunk?
- I'm not drunk, man.

55:26.280 --> 55:29.158
What I said went in one ear
and out the other, huh?

55:29.283 --> 55:30.701
Listen, man.

55:30.785 --> 55:33.079
I'm a National Intelligence Service agent,
for God's sake.

55:33.162 --> 55:35.164
How can I team up with a thug?

55:37.708 --> 55:39.001
Hey, Ho-myeong.

55:40.211 --> 55:42.171
Let's just face facts.

55:42.255 --> 55:44.423
You're about to turn 50.

55:45.383 --> 55:46.801
You're getting old.

55:46.884 --> 55:48.386
Remember the other day?

55:48.469 --> 55:50.596
When you went to see
Yoo In-gu by yourself?

55:50.680 --> 55:53.391
Back in the day,
think you would've failed against them?

55:55.643 --> 55:58.145
You can't just charge in alone
like you used to.

55:58.229 --> 56:00.189
It won't work anymore.

56:00.273 --> 56:02.567
Listen, that time...

56:03.693 --> 56:04.735
I mean...

56:10.449 --> 56:12.076
I feel bad enough as it is.

56:12.785 --> 56:14.620
Why'd you have to bring up my age?

56:57.038 --> 57:00.291
- Welcome back, boss!
- Yeah.

57:00.374 --> 57:03.002
- Any word from Detective Kim?
- Still recovering the vehicle.

57:03.085 --> 57:06.047
Once the body's found,
it'll be ruled an accidental death.

57:06.130 --> 57:09.008
That damn Detective Kim is so slow.

57:09.800 --> 57:11.385
- Kang-sik.
- Yes, sir.

57:11.469 --> 57:15.348
You need to see that bloated corpse
with your own two eyes.

57:15.431 --> 57:16.682
Understood.

57:16.766 --> 57:18.100
Kang-sik, we're almost there.

57:18.893 --> 57:21.479
Find Martial Arts Master,
and it's smooth sailing.

57:21.562 --> 57:22.855
Wait, boss.

57:22.939 --> 57:26.150
About that Martial Arts Master.
I can't find him anywhere.

57:27.151 --> 57:29.779
I can only track his phone to cell towers,
so it's not helping.

57:29.862 --> 57:33.032
- So you're giving up?
- No, I have to find him. It's just...

57:33.658 --> 57:37.828
We should prepare for the possibility
we don't find him in time.

57:40.790 --> 57:44.043
- See? Now you're using your brain.
- Huh?

57:44.627 --> 57:46.921
You're right. We need a backup plan.

57:47.004 --> 57:49.882
Double our men on the day of the deal.

57:49.966 --> 57:52.843
There's strength in numbers.
What's he going to do when we swarm him?

57:52.927 --> 57:55.972
But a large group will tip off Chief Han.

57:56.055 --> 57:59.058
- That's why you said to keep it small.
- Then we'll just use new faces.

57:59.141 --> 58:02.520
- New faces?
- There's up-and-comers in Yeongseon.

58:02.645 --> 58:05.982
You must know some.
Get them ready for the job.

58:06.065 --> 58:10.361
Our own guys got their asses kicked.
What good will they be?

58:11.529 --> 58:14.949
They can serve as kindling
for the Ingu Sect's fire, can't they?

58:28.004 --> 58:31.882
It must be hard to get things done
when it's freezing out.

58:33.050 --> 58:34.343
Thank you.

58:35.636 --> 58:38.347
But it looks like
there hasn't been much progress.

58:38.431 --> 58:41.559
- Right?
- Progress? Are you kidding?

58:41.642 --> 58:45.354
- It's a fool's errand.
- A fool's errand? Why's that?

58:46.147 --> 58:49.108
The current in the Yeongseon River
is really strong.

58:49.191 --> 58:51.569
Anyone who falls in gets swept away.

58:51.652 --> 58:53.446
They don't just stay there.

58:54.447 --> 58:57.950
They didn't find a body in the car.

58:58.034 --> 59:01.829
Probably got washed up
somewhere around Nakwon Beach.

59:01.912 --> 59:04.248
- Nakwon Beach?
- I'm telling you.

59:04.331 --> 59:08.294
If she washed up over there,
she might've even survived.

59:08.377 --> 59:11.505
I've seen people fall from here
and walk away without a scratch.

59:12.673 --> 59:15.468
But they won't listen to me
no matter what I say.

59:17.303 --> 59:20.181
That's how public officials are.
So frustrating.

59:24.602 --> 59:26.729
Keep pulling!

59:29.648 --> 59:31.317
Nakwon Beach.

01:00:07.103 --> 01:00:08.104
Jesus Christ!

01:00:08.854 --> 01:00:10.481
-You're awake.
-Who are you?

01:00:10.564 --> 01:00:12.483
- Wait!
-Who are you?

01:00:12.566 --> 01:00:15.444
Wait, it's me, prosecutor lady.

01:00:15.528 --> 01:00:17.947
- How do you know my job?
- You don't remember?

01:00:18.948 --> 01:00:21.742
- It's me.
- Who are you?

01:00:21.826 --> 01:00:23.994
I'm the one who saved you
on the beach yesterday.

01:00:25.204 --> 01:00:27.665
- I carried you here on my back.
- Yesterday?

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:30.793
Are you okay? Can you hear me?

01:00:30.876 --> 01:00:31.877
Hey.

01:00:36.257 --> 01:00:39.301
Wait, you shouldn't get up yet.
Just a moment.

01:00:39.385 --> 01:00:40.386
There we go.

01:00:40.761 --> 01:00:41.929
Hold on.

01:00:45.808 --> 01:00:49.562
Just a moment.
Let me check your temperature. Hold on.

01:00:50.354 --> 01:00:51.856
You're at 37.8 degrees.
It's gone down a bit.

01:00:51.939 --> 01:00:53.274
Just a moment.

01:00:53.357 --> 01:00:57.653
Since you fell into the sea yesterday,
you need to keep warm.

01:00:59.530 --> 01:01:01.031
Hold on.

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:04.201
Okay. There you go.

01:01:05.494 --> 01:01:08.914
You might feel fine,
but your fever could suddenly spike.

01:01:08.998 --> 01:01:10.207
But, wait.

01:01:10.875 --> 01:01:13.544
- Hold on, let me get you some water.
- No. Wait a minute.

01:01:13.627 --> 01:01:17.715
- Yes?
- I remember you saving me.

01:01:17.798 --> 01:01:19.383
But where am I?

01:01:19.508 --> 01:01:22.011
- This doesn't seem like a hospital.
- Oh, here?

01:01:23.345 --> 01:01:24.430
A temporary...

01:01:26.015 --> 01:01:29.143
- ...shelter.
- Shelter?

01:01:29.226 --> 01:01:32.354
Man, that Martial Arts Master
or whatever must be pretty scary.

01:01:32.438 --> 01:01:35.107
But don't you think you're overdoing it?

01:01:36.775 --> 01:01:40.237
He had a crazed look in his eyes.
I think he'll cause trouble again.

01:01:41.739 --> 01:01:45.034
The prosecutor was taken care of, right?

01:01:45.159 --> 01:01:48.621
Yes, once we recover the body,
it'll be ruled as an accidental death.

01:01:57.922 --> 01:01:59.590
If it weren't for this.

01:01:59.673 --> 01:02:02.885
It even has In-gu's voice on it.

01:02:02.968 --> 01:02:04.094
It's foolproof.

01:02:06.263 --> 01:02:09.225
Okay, good job. Good work.

01:02:11.227 --> 01:02:12.519
Listen.

01:02:13.520 --> 01:02:16.440
If this gets to the police,
I'll be arrested too.

01:02:17.608 --> 01:02:19.193
- Mr. Geum.
- Yes?

01:02:19.276 --> 01:02:22.446
I want President Yoo
to complete the drug deal safely.

01:02:22.529 --> 01:02:25.199
Don't worry, man.
I won't turn this over to the police.

01:02:25.282 --> 01:02:26.992
Never, not at all.

01:02:27.743 --> 01:02:28.744
Wait.

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:32.331
What do you need this for then?

01:02:32.957 --> 01:02:34.833
I'll have to figure that out as we go.

01:02:35.834 --> 01:02:37.086
You sure are curious.

01:02:38.629 --> 01:02:40.756
Listen, Mr. Geum.
You just focus on one thing.

01:02:40.839 --> 01:02:43.300
Rebuilding the Ingu Sect
to be the Kang-sik Sect.

01:02:43.384 --> 01:02:44.843
Let's get the ball rolling. Okay?

01:02:45.970 --> 01:02:48.764
Yes. I'll make the preparations.

01:02:49.139 --> 01:02:51.308
- Okay.
- Oh, one more thing.

01:02:56.480 --> 01:03:00.109
Mr. Geum is one ambitious man.

01:03:00.192 --> 01:03:01.485
All right then.

01:03:04.697 --> 01:03:06.573
He'll make it big in no time.

01:04:27.780 --> 01:04:31.909
- Wait, that one's not expired yet.
- Oh. Right.

01:04:33.160 --> 01:04:35.079
It's not like you to make such a mistake.

01:04:36.080 --> 01:04:40.376
Did something happen yesterday
with the CCTV footage?

01:04:44.630 --> 01:04:47.132
Yesterday, I met Jeong Ho-myeong.

01:04:49.176 --> 01:04:51.804
You met Jeong Ho-myeong?

01:04:51.887 --> 01:04:52.971
Right.

01:04:54.223 --> 01:04:59.186
But that guy didn't just know me.
He knows a lot about you, too.

01:05:01.021 --> 01:05:02.272
Did he?

01:05:02.856 --> 01:05:06.068
- He said he knew me?
- Yeah.

01:05:06.151 --> 01:05:08.946
And not just our faces.

01:05:10.155 --> 01:05:12.783
He even knows why we came
to Yeongseon Island ten years ago.

01:05:13.867 --> 01:05:15.786
He knew about us, inside and out.

01:05:20.999 --> 01:05:22.126
Okay, look.

01:05:23.001 --> 01:05:24.837
- There's something I need to tell you.
- Go on.

01:05:44.857 --> 01:05:47.651
SPECIAL THANKS TO KWON YUL

01:06:02.332 --> 01:06:06.295
Listen up, I'm about to make you
an offer you can't refuse.

01:06:06.420 --> 01:06:09.506
You're getting old.
You can't do anything by yourself anymore.

01:06:09.590 --> 01:06:11.091
I accept your offer.

01:06:11.175 --> 01:06:12.509
-Move.
-Out of my way!

01:06:12.593 --> 01:06:14.803
That bastard Yoo In-gu is dealing drugs?

01:06:14.887 --> 01:06:17.639
- Let's focus on our deal.
- You don't remember anything?

01:06:17.723 --> 01:06:20.142
- I have no idea.
- Did you find out who she is?

01:06:20.225 --> 01:06:21.685
Mi-kyung is interested in me too.

01:06:22.686 --> 01:06:23.687
Should I just lock him up?

01:06:25.147 --> 01:06:27.483
- She'll probably just tear it.
- We don't work for you.

01:06:27.566 --> 01:06:29.610
- It's over.
- We face them head-on.

01:06:29.693 --> 01:06:32.905
- Are you sure you can take them down?
- I'll find a way.
